BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pt-irs-retencao-payment@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261006T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261020
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261021
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=20
SUMMARY:Portugal: IRS withholding on employment income: payment to the tax 
 authority
DESCRIPTION:Amounts withheld on employment income (IRS) must be paid over b
 y the 20th of the month following the one in which they were deducted.\nAp
 plies to: Employers withholding IRS on employment income\nNon-working-day 
 rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://info.portaldasfinancas.gov.pt/p
 t/informacao_fiscal/codigos_tributarios/cirs_rep/Pages/irs98.aspx\nDetails
 : https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#portugal\n\nFor informa
 tion only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule state
 d by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sources last chec
 ked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#portugal
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pt-dmr-monthly@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261006T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=10
SUMMARY:Portugal: Monthly remuneration declaration (DMR) to the tax authori
 ty
DESCRIPTION:Employers file the official declaration of income paid\, tax wi
 thheld\, mandatory social-protection contributions and union dues by the 1
 0th of the month following payment\, for employment income.\nApplies to: E
 mployers paying employment income\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.
 \n\nSource: https://info.portaldasfinancas.gov.pt/pt/informacao_fiscal/cod
 igos_tributarios/cirs_rep/Pages/irs119.aspx\nDetails: https://www.intellig
 entpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#portugal\n\nFor information only\, not legal 
 or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; week
 ends and holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#portugal
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pt-employee-income-statement@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261006T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270121
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=1;BYMONTHDAY=20
SUMMARY:Portugal: Annual statement of pay and tax withheld to each employee
DESCRIPTION:By 20 January each year\, give the taxpayer a document showing 
 the amounts due in the previous year\, including income in kind\, tax with
 held and any deductions.\nApplies to: Employers and other payers of income
  subject to IRS\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https:
 //info.portaldasfinancas.gov.pt/pt/informacao_fiscal/codigos_tributarios/c
 irs_rep/Pages/irs119.aspx\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/dead
 lines.html#portugal\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dat
 es follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays 
 are not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#portugal
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pt-ss-contributions-payment@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261006T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=25
SUMMARY:Portugal: Social security contributions payment (employers)
DESCRIPTION:Contributions are paid monthly\, based on data made available b
 y social security\, between day 1 and day 25 of the month after the one th
 ey relate to. New model phased in during 2026\; mandatory for all employer
 s from 1 Jan 2027.\nApplies to: Employers declaring remuneration to Portug
 uese social security\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: h
 ttps://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2025/12/23600/0000200005.pdf\nDetails
 : https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#portugal\n\nFor informa
 tion only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule state
 d by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sources last chec
 ked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#portugal
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
